OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPersistent, at times heavy rain
OL,6,Fwill continue in the north, with a
OL,7,Frisk of hail and thunder across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland. Scattered showers
OL,9,Felsewhere, mainly in western areas.
OL,10,FVery warm and humid conditions persist
OL,11,Fin the east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain is likely to continue
OL,14,Facross the north, with scattered
OL,15,Fshowers elsewhere. It will be mostly
OL,16,Fdry across eastern and southeastern
OL,17,FEngland, where another warm night is
OL,18,Fexpected.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
