OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,6,Frain will continue across northern
OL,7,Fareas, with a risk of hail and
OL,8,Fthunder. Sunny spells elsewhere. Windy
OL,9,Fin the north, with temperatures nearer
OL,10,Fnormal.
